    "text": "By Erika Esquivel ,\n11 hours ago RUIDOSO, N.M. (KFOX14/CBS4) — The mountain village of Ruidoso has once again earned national recognition, taking the top spot in the 2026 USA TODAY 10Best Readers’ Choice Awards for Best Small Town Cultural Scene, marking its second consecutive win. The annual awards highlight standout destinations across the United... Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak 1",
